# R8 keep rules for RatePrince. AGP combines every file in src/main/keepRules/.
#
# R8 full mode (the default) keeps a class named by a bare "-keep class" rule but NOT its
# constructor. Glance's consumer rule for action callbacks is written that way, and Glance
# instantiates callbacks by class name via reflection, so without this the widget's swap
# button crashes in release builds.
-keep class * implements androidx.glance.appwidget.action.ActionCallback {
    <init>();
}
